Save and restore exact training state after every epoch.

Modal functions stop after 24 h, and a full ASL-Citizen-1500 extractor epoch
takes ~3.6 h, so a run must survive restarts. The published trainers can only
reload model weights (--weights_path), losing optimizer, scheduler,
early-stopping and RNG state. This writes resume.pt after each completed epoch
and restores all of it on start; an uninterrupted run is unchanged.

